Go ahead and get the executable  (NH313PC or NH313386)
When you execute that file it will unpack itself into a whole
bunch of files, levels and all.  You might want to make sure
that is is sittting in C:\GAMES\NETHACK.  (If you don't have
it there, you can always edit the Config file when you see it.)

In other words, the EXE file you see on the net isn't the game, per se.
It's a packed/zipped/tarred or whatever file which has everything in it.
Running the Executable will set up your game.  It will spew a NETHACK.EXE
for you to run as the game.

Just be sure that you transfer that file in Binary mode.

